From: Dakota maintainers
Subject: Build rounded blur for Mutter 51 and resolve the actor's CoglContext
Upstream-Status: Submitted [https://github.com/kancko/gnome-rounded-blur/pull/7]

Port of upstream commit c0d67c886ac0b54fedaddf75817e85264d16322e.
Dakota additionally requires every Mutter dependency to use ABI 51 and
version >= 51.0, < 52.0. Use Mutter's exported GIR and private-library
directories for introspection and installed-library loading.
Drop the C port when merged upstream; retain an explicit ABI boundary when
updating the source and GNOME junction together.

--- a/meson.build
+++ b/meson.build
@@ -21,8 +21,8 @@
